{"speech": "A contemporary resource room with an elegant and sophisticated layout awaits you, featuring an inviting ethereal palette on the walls and lavish bohemian-inspired flooring. Four sleek white bookshelves made of polished wood stand adjacent to each other, with the first near a vibrant green ceramic plant and a soft gray geometric sound-absorbing panel. The fourth bookshelf is a meter away from a deep navy lacquered wood storage cabinet, opposite another cabinet beside a decorative plant. Two warm oak reading tables, flanked by brushed brass floor lamps, sit between ergonomic beige mesh chairs. A plush gray modular sofa rests on a muted teal artistic rug, with a third floor lamp nearby. A matte black wall-mounted projector overlooks a glossy white magnetic whiteboard, while five decorative plants and a matte silver charging station add life and functionality. Five adjustable chairs and two frosted glass pendant lights complete the space, along with four sound-absorbing panels. The room is accessible via a sleek silver sliding door with tempered glass, blending minimalist design with practicality."}
